msgid "``buzzer`` module removed *(minor)*"
msgstr "``buzzer`` 모듈 제거됨 *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:186
msgid ""
"The ``buzzer`` module was removed from the STM32 and i.MX RT ports. Drive "
"the buzzer with :class:`machine.PWM` instead; a Pure Thermal buzzer example "
"using PWM was added."
msgstr ""
"``buzzer`` 모듈이 STM32와 i.MX RT 포트에서 제거되었습니다. 대신 :class:`machine.PWM`\\ 으로 버저를"
" 구동하세요; PWM을 사용하는 Pure Thermal 버저 예제가 추가되었습니다."

